rs in einen Hund oder der Chourineur", "level": 5, "id": "h11-3", "source_file": "ME02-172.html", "chapter_number": 11, "filename": "ME02-172.html"}, {"tag": "h5", "text": "2. Enthüllung des Geheimnisses der kritischen Religion oder Fleur de Marie", "level": 5, "id": "h11-4", "source_file": "ME02-172.html", "chapter_number": 11, "filename": "ME02-172.html"}, {"tag": "h5", "text": "a) Die spekulative »Marien-Blume«", "level": 5, "id": "h11-5", "source_file": "ME02-172.html", "chapter_number": 11, "filename": "ME02-172.html"}, {"tag": "h5", "text": "b) Fleur de Marie", "level": 5, "id": "h11-6", "source_file": "ME02-172.html", "chapter_number": 11, "filename": "ME02-172.html"}, {"tag": "h5", "text": "3. Enthüllung der Geheimnisse des Rechts", "level": 5, "id": "h11-7", "source_file": "ME02-172.html", "chapter_number": 11, "filename": "ME02-172.html"}, {"tag": "h5", "text": "a) Der maître d'école oder die neue Straftheorie. Das enthüllte Geheimnis des Zellularsystems. Medizinische Geheimnisse", "level": 5, "id": "h11-8", "source_file": "ME02-172.html", "chapter_number": 11, "filename": "ME02-172.html"}, {"tag": "h5", "text": "b) Belohnung und Strafe. Die doppelte Justiz, nebst Tabelle", "level": 5, "id": "h11-9", "source_file": "ME02-172.html", "chapter_number": 11, "filename": "ME02-172.html"}, {"tag": "h5", "text": "Tabelle der kritisch vollständigen Justiz", "level": 5, "id": "h11-10", "source_file": "ME02-172.html", "chapter_number": 11, "filename": "ME02-172.html"}, {"tag": "h5", "text": "c) Aufhebung der Verwilderung innerhalb der Zivilisation und der Rechtslosigkeit im Staate", "level": 5, "id": "h11-11", "source_file": "ME02-172.html", "chapter_number": 11, "filename": "ME02-172.html"}, {"tag": "h5", "text": "4. Das enthüllte Geheimnis des »Standpunktes«", "level": 5, "id": "h11-12", "source_file": "ME02-172.html", "chapter_number": 11, "filename": "ME02-172.html"}, {"tag": "h5", "text": "5. Enthüllung des Geheimnisses von der Utilisierung der menschlichen Trie